# The units that DN takes from Borland Turbo Vision (replaced by tv/, PLAN.md decisions 6 and 11) and what
# gives their names: `UnitName: TvUnit TvUnit...` (tools/gen-shim.py, called by tools/dn-materialize.sh).
# What DN adds to TV, and the names that differ, are in dn/new/manual/UNIT.inc (interface) and
# UNIT.impl.inc (implementation).
Defines:  TvGeom TvObjs TvUtil TvEvents TvKeys TvViews TvWindow TvDialog TvMsgBox TvCluster TvList TvInput +osdep +SysUtils -TCollection -PCollection -TSortedCollection -PSortedCollection -TStringCollection -PStringCollection -TItemList -PItemList -MessageBox -MessageBoxRect -MessageBoxFmt -MessageBoxRectFmt -InputBox -InputBoxRect -mfWarning -mfError -mfInformation -mfConfirmation -mfYesButton -mfNoButton -mfOKButton -mfCancelButton -mfYesNoCancel -mfOKCancel -kb*
_Defines: TvGeom TvObjs TvUtil TvEvents TvKeys TvViews TvWindow TvDialog TvMsgBox TvCluster TvList TvInput +osdep +SysUtils -TCollection -PCollection -TSortedCollection -PSortedCollection -TStringCollection -PStringCollection -TItemList -PItemList -MessageBox -MessageBoxRect -MessageBoxFmt -MessageBoxRectFmt -InputBox -InputBoxRect -mfWarning -mfError -mfInformation -mfConfirmation -mfYesButton -mfNoButton -mfOKButton -mfCancelButton -mfYesNoCancel -mfOKCancel -kb*
Views:    TvGeom TvColors TvCell TvKeys TvEvents TvDrawBuf TvText TvUtil TvObjs TvViews TvWindow -TDrawBuffer +SysUtils -TCollection -PCollection -TSortedCollection -PSortedCollection -TStringCollection -PStringCollection -TItemList -PItemList -kb*
_Views:   TvGeom TvColors TvCell TvKeys TvEvents TvDrawBuf TvText TvUtil TvObjs TvViews TvWindow -TDrawBuffer +SysUtils -TCollection -PCollection -TSortedCollection -PSortedCollection -TStringCollection -PStringCollection -TItemList -PItemList -kb*
